{"schemaVersion":1,"id":289,"sections":[{"id":"540001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20704],"start":0,"count":10},{"id":"540001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20705],"start":10,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:1","scriptId":20704,"text":"佩妮睁开了眼睛，眼前的景色不由得让她大吃一惊。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:2","scriptId":20704,"text":"“这里是蘑菇林……之前我不是还在沙漠吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:3","scriptId":20704,"text":"努力回想之前的行为，佩妮想起了自己在失去意识之前因为没摸到吉普车而被风沙给刮跑了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:4","scriptId":20704,"text":"“这下糟糕了……和长官他们分开了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:5","scriptId":20704,"text":"佩妮抓了一把地面的泥土，仔细闻了闻。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:6","scriptId":20704,"text":"“是新鲜泥土的味道……看来之前那些绝对不是简单的海市蜃楼。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:7","scriptId":20704,"text":"仔细确认了一下自身的装备，好在弹药包和水壶都带在自己身上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:8","scriptId":20704,"text":"“现在不能慌张，先在原地等等。如果情况没有变化就寻找高地确认周围地形。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:9","scriptId":20704,"text":"这时，佩妮发现了几头战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-PROLOGUE:20704:10","scriptId":20704,"text":"“这些家伙会成为隐患，优先排除，必须一击必杀，节约弹药。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:0","scriptId":20705,"text":"只用了几发炮弹就解决了全部的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:1","scriptId":20705,"text":"“已经完全没有了沙尘暴的迹象……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:2","scriptId":20705,"text":"“看来只能先往高地移动了，不知道能不能找到长官和佐伊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:3","scriptId":20705,"text":"很快，佩妮来到了一处高地，能够鸟瞰周围的低洼地形。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:4","scriptId":20705,"text":"“不得了……来到了个完全不认识的地方啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:5","scriptId":20705,"text":"佩妮看着周围的地区，那是一望无际的树海和成片的蘑菇林。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:6","scriptId":20705,"text":"“如果是长官他们的话绝对有几率和战车兽遇上，等等看吧，或许会有动静。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:7","scriptId":20705,"text":"佩妮找了棵倒塌的大树坐了下来，约莫等了十分钟。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:10","scriptId":20705,"text":"下面的区域里出现了爆炸声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:11","scriptId":20705,"text":"“有动静！很有可能是长官他们！得过去看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:12","scriptId":20705,"text":"于是佩妮朝着爆炸点一路飞驰。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-19.webp","left":1187,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:15","scriptId":20705,"text":"“之后的剧情正在施工中……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:16","scriptId":20705,"text":"…………","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"540001-EPILOGUE:20705:17","scriptId":20705,"text":"…………待续","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
